# At the doctor in Russian: что у вас боли́т?
subtitle: "Get through a visit to the doctor in Russian: say у меня́ температу́ра, у меня́ ка́шель, and understand вы должны́ принима́ть лека́рство три ра́за в день."
tags: ["russian","at the doctor","russian health","лекарство","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/at-the-doctor","vocabulary/health"]
thumb: "band \"At the doctor: say what's wrong\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Jobs in Russian: кем вы рабо́таете?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/77-russian-jobs.cast"}

## At the doctor in Russian: что у вас боли́т?
