A: How do you get through a visit to the doctor in Russian? (@draw k0@) You can already say у меня́ боли́т го́рло.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Today you go к врачу́: what else is wrong, and what the doctor tells you to do. (@draw masha masha_name@) Listen first: Masha is the doctor, and I'm the patient.
    highlight k0 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase k0

B: Что у вас боли́т?
    draw balloon_m caption false

    erase balloon_m

    draw balloon_t

    ask "Besides a headache, what does he have?" voice a options ["a sore leg","a temperature","a cough"] correct 2
        gloss: I have a headache, and I have a fever.
        listen: У меня́ боли́т голова́, и у меня́ температу́ра.
        right: A temperature: у меня́ температу́ра.
        wrong: Listen to the end: температу́ра.

    erase balloon_t

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Температу́ра sounds like temperature, and у меня́ температу́ра means I have a fever.
    draw i_fever s1

B: And no есть: when you (@draw g1 g2 g3@) tell the doctor what's (@draw g_x@) wrong, Russian usually leaves it out.
    highlight s1_w_1 s1_w_2 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase g1 g2 g3 g_x

A: Ка́шель is a cough, and it goes the same way: у меня́ ка́шель.
    draw i_cough s2

B: Then the doctor asks: кака́я у вас температу́ра?
    draw s3

A: Три́дцать во́семь. Thirty-eight: that's a fever.
    draw s4 s4_c

    erase i_fever s1 i_cough s2 s3 s4 s4_c

A: So she gives you лека́рство: medicine.
    draw i_pill m1

B: You take it with принима́ть: я принима́ю лека́рство, like чита́ю.
    draw m2

    highlight m2 color #5b8c5a effect underline part принима́ю

A: How often? Раз is one time; you know it from ещё раз, in lesson forty-one.
    draw r1

B: After два, три, четы́ре it takes an а, as in два часа́: три ра́за.
    draw r2

    highlight r2 color #c9871a part а$

A: And в день is a day: три ра́за в день, three times a day.
    draw r3

    quiz "Twice a day: два … в день?" store chk voice a
        right: Два ра́за: after два, the а, as in два часа́.
        wrong: After два, три, четы́ре: the а of два часа́.
        + ра́за
        * раз
        * ра́зы

    erase i_pill m1 m2 r1 r2 r3

B: Вы должны́ принима́ть лека́рство три ра́за в день.
    draw d1 d2

A: Вы должны́: you must. And принима́ть is (@highlight d1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part принима́ть@) the doing verb, because you take it again and again.
    highlight d1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part "^Вы должны́"

A: Then she gives you a реце́пт, a prescription. In the kitchen, the same word means a recipe.
    draw i_rx rx rx_g

B: Не забу́дьте реце́пт!
    draw d3

A: That's не забу́дь, with те for вы: the doctor's last word.
    highlight d3 color #5b8c5a effect underline part те$

    erase d1 d2 i_rx rx rx_g d3

A: Now the whole visit. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw q_cough

    quiz "You have a cough. Tell the doctor." reveal.text "У меня́ ка́шель." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: У меня́ ка́шель: with у меня́, and no есть.
        wrong: Say it the way you say у меня́ боли́т го́рло.
        * Мне ка́шель.
        * Я ка́шель.
        + У меня́ ка́шель.

    erase q_cough

    draw q_rx

    quiz "The doctor doesn't want you to forget your prescription. What does she say?" reveal.text "Не забу́дьте реце́пт!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Не забу́дьте реце́пт: don't forget, and реце́пт is the prescription.
        wrong: Don't forget needs не; the prescription is реце́пт.
        + Не забу́дьте реце́пт!
        * Забу́дьте реце́пт!
        * Не забу́дьте лека́рство!

    erase q_rx

    draw q_pill1 q_pill2

    quiz "The doctor says: Вы должны́ принима́ть лека́рство два ра́за в день. How often?" say_answer false reveal.text "два ра́за в день" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Twice a day: два ра́за в день.
        wrong: Ра́за counts the times; в день is a day.
        * once a day
        + twice a day
        * for two days

    erase q_pill1 q_pill2

    draw q_fever q_cough2

    ask "Tell the doctor what's wrong." voice a show cue test t1
        gloss: I have a fever and a cough.
        say_it: У меня́ температу́ра и ка́шель.

A: У меня́ температу́ра и ка́шель.
    draw q_say

    erase q_fever q_cough2 q_say

    draw q_doc

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Tell a patient (вы): You must take the medicine three times a day." answer ["вы должны принимать лекарство три раза в день","должны принимать лекарство три раза в день","вы должны принимать лекарство три раза в день."] voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Должны́ for вы, then the doing verb, because it's again and again.
        wrong: Start with вы, then must for вы, then to take, medicine, and three times a day.

B: Вы должны́ принима́ть лека́рство три ра́за в день.
    draw q_b1 q_b2

    erase q_doc q_b1 q_b2

    group sum members ["sum1","sum2","sum3"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So at the doctor's: say what's wrong with у меня́, and no есть; then listen (@highlight sum3 color #5b8c5a effect underline@) for how often: три ра́за в день.
    highlight sum1 color #5b8c5a effect underline part "^У меня́"

    erase sum

B: Не забу́дьте: три ра́за в день! До свида́ния!
    icon end_doc size 170 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["woman","girl"] icon_look picture of "woman health worker"
    icon end_pill size 140 set twemoji x 620 y 470 or ["syringe"] icon_look picture of pill
    text end_say "Не забу́дьте: три ра́за в день!" say "Не забу́дьте: три ра́за в день!" say_voice b x 500 y 290 font_size 56

    erase end_doc end_pill end_say

A: Next time: jobs. Кем вы рабо́таете?
    box next77 "Next: lesson 77 · Кем вы рабо́таете?" say "Кем вы рабо́таете?" x 500 y 430 width 760 height 130 radius 14 font_size 42

